# AICL Example: Grade Letter
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Score to grade

Layer:
Core

Behavior Grade
    Input: score
    Output: grade
    Action:
        if score >= 90:
            return "A"
        elif score >= 80:
            return "B"
        elif score >= 70:
            return "C"
        elif score >= 60:
            return "D"
        return "F"
